00:09:13.340 --> 00:09:14.738
Il a son plan.

00:09:14.739 --> 00:09:16.378
Ne révélez pas son identité,

00:09:16.379 --> 00:09:17.900
surtout à ce dragon des inondations.

00:09:20.419 --> 00:09:21.540
Ce dragon des inondations...

00:09:22.139 --> 00:09:24.299
Où est M. Feng ?

00:09:24.300 --> 00:09:25.179
Oh non!

00:09:25.180 --> 00:09:26.778
Nous l'avons laissé derrière nous !

00:09:26.779 --> 00:09:27.939
Rester calme.

00:09:27.940 --> 00:09:28.979
Il est resté derrière

00:09:28.980 --> 00:09:30.418
