00:09:30.419 --> 00:09:31.898
Quelle mission ?

00:09:31.899 --> 00:09:34.339
Elle l'a mentionné.

00:09:34.379 --> 00:09:35.939
Vous ne comprendriez pas.

00:09:35.940 --> 00:09:36.738
Hé, gamin.

00:09:36.739 --> 00:09:38.620
Appelez-moi Ancêtre.

00:09:39.050 --> 00:09:42.339
